     2967         run wp-xmltagput in this-procedure ( input 1 + 4, input substitute('&1', 'f22'),  input string(buf_fin-doc.f23), input 1 ).
     2968         run wp-xmltagput in this-procedure ( input 1 + 4, input substitute('&1', 'f23ReservField'),  input string(buf_fin-doc.f23), input 1 ).
