     2976               run wp-xmltagput in this-procedure ( input 1 + 4, input substitute('&1', 'taxPaymentBase'),  input string(buf_fin-doc.f106), input 1 ).
     2977               run wp-xmltagput in this-procedure ( input 1 + 4, input substitute('&1', 'taxPeriod'),  input string(buf_fin-doc.f107), input 1 ).
